[E0436] Error: `bytes` is used after `n`, which it borrows, was changed
    ╭─[ err/506_bytes_kept_past_a_change/main.wip:10:12 ]
    │
  8 │     val bytes = c::bytesOf(&n)
    │         ──┬──
    │           ╰──── `bytes` borrows `n`
  9 │     n = 2
    │     ┬
    │     ╰── `n` assigned here
 10 │     assert(bytes.len() == 4)
    │            ──┬──
    │              ╰──── used here
    │
    │ Help: use `bytes` before `n` changes, or keep a copy of the value it points to
    │
    │ Note: a `&` reference points into the place it borrows, so that must not change while the reference is still used
────╯
